ion=\"Citation for case: Pruitt v. State\">373 S. E. 2d 192</a></span>; No. 89-5223, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"2061012\"><a href=\"/opinion/2061012/people-v-mack/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: People v. MacK\">128 Ill. 2d 231</a></span>, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"2061012\"><a href=\"/opinion/2061012/people-v-mack/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: People v. MacK\">538 N. E. 2d 1107</a></span>; No. 89-6166, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1799864\"><a href=\"/opinion/1799864/tompkins-v-dugger/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Tompkins v. Dugger\">549 So. 2d 1370</a></span>; No. 89-6192, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"2455374\"><a href=\"/opinion/2455374/murray-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Murray v. State\">775 S. W. 2d 89</a></span>; No. 89-6427, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1203661\"><a href=\"/opinion/1203661/spencer-v-commonwealth/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Spencer v. Commonwealth\">238 Va. 295</a></span>, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1203661\"><a href=\"/opinion/1203661/spencer-v-commonwealth/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Spencer v. Commonwealth\">384 S. E. 2d 785</a></span>; No. 89-6435, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1228881\"><a href=\"/opinion/1228881/spencer-v-commonwealth/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Spencer v. Commonwealth\">238 Va. 563</a></span>, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1228881\"><a href=\"/opinion/1228881/spencer-v-commonwealth/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Spencer v. Commonwealth\">385 S. E. 2d 850</a></span>.</p>\n</opinion>"},{"id":9089499,"type":"dissent","typeCode":"040dissent","perCuriam":false,"author":"Brennanmarshall","joinedBy":"","pageCount":null,"textLength":599,"isHtml":true,"text":"<opinion type=\"dissent\">\n<author id=\"b1031-12\">Justice Brennan and Justice Marshall,</author>\n<p id=\"AOA_\">dissenting.</p>\n<p id=\"b1031-13\">Adhering to our views that the death penalty is in all circumstances cruel and unusual punishment prohibited by the Eighth and Fourteenth Amendments, <em>Gregg </em>v. <em>Georgia, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9426555\"><a href=\"/opinion/109532/gregg-v-georgia/#227\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Gregg v. Georgia\">428 U. S. 153, 227, 231</a></span> (1976), we would grant certiorari and vacate the death sentences in these cases.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}